  "description": "PostgreSQL SQL migration runner for EF-free (NativeAOT) Elarion hosts (ADR-0057): embedded V{version}__/R__ scripts, SHA-256 checksums over line-ending-normalized content, a session-level advisory lock, and history rows that commit in the same transaction as their script — so there is no repair command and no failed-row limbo. Startup-applied via a hosted service; PostgreSQL only by design.",
